    "title": "How to live stream Nuggets vs Spurs: Watch NBA, TV channel",
    "text": "The Denver Nuggets face the San Antonio Spurs in a Western Conference matchup between two of the league’s hottest teams heading into the postseason. MORE: Nikola Jokic makes bold Victor Wembanyama claim after Nuggets-Spurs thriller Apr 4, 2026; Denver, Colorado, USA; San Antonio Spurs forward Victor Wembanyama (1) prepares to shoot the ball over Denver Nuggets forward Aaron Gordon (32) during the second half at Ball Arena. Mandatory Credit: Ron Chenoy-Imagn Images How to Watch Nuggets vs Spurs When: Sunday, April 12, 2026 Time: 8:30 PM ET TV Channel: Altitude Sports / FanDuel Sports Net Southeast Live Stream: Fubo (try for free) Denver enters at 53–28, riding an 11-game winning streak and having already secured a top-four seed in the West. Nikola Jokić continues to lead the way, stuffing the stat sheet nightly and coming off a dominant recent matchup against San Antonio, where he posted 31 points, 20 rebounds, and 12 assists in a 136–131 win. That game also saw Jamal Murray drop 39 points, highlighting Denver’s ability to explode offensively, especially late. They outscored the Spurs heavily in the second half to complete a comeback from a 20-point deficit. Live stream Nuggets vs Spurs on Fubo Advertisement San Antonio, however, has been just as impressive, entering at 62–19 and locking up the No. 2 seed in the West while winning 14 of their last 15 games. The Spurs are led by Victor Wembanyama, who is coming off a 40-point, 13-rebound performance in their most recent game and has consistently dominated both ends of the floor. San Antonio’s depth has also been a major factor, with multiple players contributing in double figures during this stretch, making them one of the most balanced teams in the league. With both teams playing elite basketball and their last meeting producing a 136–131 thriller, this matchup has clear playoff-level intensity. Denver’s high-powered offense and experience go head-to-head with San Antonio’s size, depth, and momentum, making this a potential Western Conference preview with very little separating the two sides. Advertisement This is a great NBA matchup that you will not want to miss; make sure to tune in and catch all the action. Live stream Nuggets vs Spurs on Fubo: Start your free trial now! With Fubo, you can watch live television without cable on your phone, TV, or tablet. Fubo carries a wide array of sports and entertainment channels, including local sports packages and top national channels like ABC, FOX, CBS, ESPN, FS1, MTV, Comedy Central, and much more. The best part is you can try it out today for free. Regional restrictions may apply. If you purchase a product or register for an account through one of the links on our site, we may receive compensation. — Enjoy free coverage of the top news & trending stories on The Big Lead —",
